window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Social butterfly. Life of the party. Single for life. While all my friends were busy getting married and making babies, I was happy I wasn't one of them.<br> <br> A series of life-altering events put me on a collision course with Rori O'Shea, the sexiest Irishman I've ever met, and also the grumpiest.<br> <br> We clashed at first sight and yet, ended up striking a bargain. He needs a fake girlfriend, and I need a guide in Ireland.<br> <br> Our relationship should be strictly business, but the more time we spend together, the more the lines begin to blur.<br> <br> I have to resist the temptation, though. The worst thing that could happen to me is to fall for a man whose heart is as closed to love as mine was.<br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
